}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["《中小学生健康体检管理办法（2021 年版）》规定，中小学校每年组织 1 次在校学生健康体检。外科检查包括头部、颈部、胸部、脊柱、四肢、皮肤、淋巴结。眼科检查包括眼外观、远视力、屈光度（近视远视的度数）。发给个人的报告单应包括查出来的结果、总的评价和健康指导建议。其中超重、肥胖、营养不良、脊柱弯曲异常、视力不良、龋齿（蛀牙）须作为指导重点。教育行政部门应当对出现健康问题的学生建立档案并随访（记下来、之后再跟进）。义务教育阶段学生健康体检费用由学校公用经费开支，家长不另掏（全国，2021 年 9 月印发）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原始出处"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国家卫生健康委、教育部 (2021). 中小学生健康体检管理办法（2021 年版）（国卫医发〔2021〕29 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-10/21/content_5644100.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-10/21/content_5644100.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-10/21/content_5644100.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["给 B 是因为这是一份规定学校怎么做的文件，不是效果研究。它保证的是「每年查、查这几项、发现异常要跟进」，不保证查出来就有人管。体检只是先筛一遍，不是确诊。视力不良要去眼科做散瞳验光（第 12 条）。脊柱弯曲异常要去骨科或脊柱外科（第 2 条，别为了等考完推迟治疗）。这两步都得家长自己带孩子去。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/30-06"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"把近视当成会留下的损伤：度数越深，将来视网膜脱离、黄斑病变、青光眼越多"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/30-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"12 到 18 岁的孩子做一次抑郁筛查，别拿学校的心理测评当诊断"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["孩子被欺凌，当天就报到学校并要求书面处理，涉及打人、抢钱、传谣的直接报警"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["被同伴欺凌的孩子，冒出自杀念头的可能约是没被欺凌的 2.2 倍，有过自杀行为的约 2.6 倍。学校接到报告要立即调查，认定是欺凌就要处分，…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{